// Helm 4 requires filepath-securejoin v0.7.0, which dropped the deprecated
// root-level OpenInRoot/OpenatInRoot/Reopen aliases. github.com/containers/storage
// (pulled in by replicatedhq/troubleshoot v0.113.0) still calls them, so the
// linux build breaks on v0.7.0. v0.5.2 (released alongside v0.6.1 with the same
// fixes) keeps the aliases; Helm only calls SecureJoin, which is unchanged.
// Drop this once troubleshoot is >= v0.123.17 (no containers/storage dependency).
replace github.com/cyphar/filepath-securejoin => github.com/cyphar/filepath-securejoin v0.5.2
